From f9135a7cd4af4d93a6a89f24ff51eafc45c93291 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wmehanna <wassimmehanna@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:43:11 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(vmapple): add the ambrosia=on machine layout

-machine vmapple,ambrosia=on boots through the Ambrosia open firmware
instead of AVPBooter: RAM at 0x100000000 with the PCIe MMIO window
below it, 64-bit IOSurface registers, an avp-rtc at 0x30240000, a
doorbell and no SME.
---
